# AMS Lane Detection

A robust lane detection and perspective transformation pipeline optimized for OAK-D cameras (DepthAI) and edge devices (like Jetson). This repository includes real-time inference scripts, video recording utilities, and interactive calibration tools for generating perfect Bird's Eye View (BEV) projections.

